@startuml
title GoalZone - Admin audit and reporting use cases
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #B45309
  ArrowColor #475569
}

actor Admin

rectangle GoalZone {
  package "Commercial audit" #FFF7ED {
    usecase "UC-25\nView booking detail" as UC25
    usecase "UC-43\nView payment history" as UC43
    usecase "UC-45\nView invoice status" as UC45
    usecase "UC-46\nProcess online refund" as UC46
    usecase "UC-47\nManage refund requests" as UC47
  }
  package "Reports" #FEF2F2 {
    usecase "UC-59\nView revenue report" as UC59
    usecase "UC-60\nView booking report" as UC60
    usecase "UC-61\nView Customer activity report" as UC61
  }
}

Admin --> UC25
Admin --> UC43
Admin --> UC45
Admin --> UC46
Admin --> UC47
Admin --> UC59
Admin --> UC60
Admin --> UC61

note bottom
Reports use the selected date period. Cancelled/rejected/expired bookings do not inflate
commercial value or utilization, and raw database IDs are not presentation fields.
end note
@enduml
